[51.453396, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ parses a signature header with two v1 entries \u001b[90m(1.128174ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[51.453804, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ accepts a correctly signed body \u001b[90m(0.963828ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a body signed with the wrong secret \u001b[90m(0.763942ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a stale timestamp \u001b[90m(0.318ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ policy: small INR refunds auto-approve, others go to review \u001b[90m(1.25123ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[51.453936, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ cancelling a pending refund \u001b[90m(3.81105ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ a redelivered event creates only one refund \u001b[90m(1.217844ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ authz: keys map to role permissions \u001b[90m(1.741624ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
